@startuml run-states
!theme plain
title Run states (run/1)

[*] --> accepted
accepted --> refused : prepare or capacity refused
accepted --> provisioning : gates open
accepted --> queued : v1 only: a gate is closed
queued --> provisioning : gate opens
queued --> cancelled : cancel or window passed
provisioning --> starting : account + binding confirmed
provisioning --> failed : compensation: unbind, retire
starting --> running : executor started
starting --> failed : compensation: stop, retire
running --> stopping : exit, cancel or max_runtime
stopping --> cleaning : exit recorded
cleaning --> done : unbound + retired (or kept)
cleaning --> cleaning : retry with backoff
refused --> [*]
failed --> [*]
cancelled --> [*]
done --> [*]
note right of provisioning
  every stage is journaled before its effect
  and confirmed after it; reconciliation
  resumes or rolls back from the journal
end note
@enduml
